            "review_title": "Review at Pho Dau",
            "review_text": "dungmiakem\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam794 contributions\n0\nawesome parking guy. great pho broth\nJun 2024 • Solo\nI have been eating here since 1994. the shop is equal with my father age. still longing for this pho broth every week. the portion gets bigger as price gets higher, but still worth it. they put trash can at every table and clean everything throughfully. hence, the shop is clean and tidy. the offered free hot tea, just ask them for a cup to drink tea and you will see the magic. bank transfer or cash for payment method.the parking guy is awesome. he can remember your vehicle and never ask for tips. only car need to pay parking fee.\nRead more\nWritten June 23, 2024",
