            "review_title": "Review at Pho Dau",
            "review_text": "Daisy\n55 contributions\n0\nGreat local flavour\nApr 2019 • Friends\nLocated in Ho Chi Minh city since 1958, but this noodle shop has northern flavour Phở. Everything is perfect: soup, beef, the staffs' attitude. They have English menu and there is one staff who can speak English very well. We often come here to have breakfast. \nA small note, the fish-sauce flavor and smell is very obvious in the soup. If you don't like fish sauce, you might not like Phở Dậu.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 5, 2019",
